  "details": "Whenever a sound is played and it has a VRC Spatial Audio Source script on it, it either doesn't change the audio curve at all, improperly changes it  for a frame or two, or it plays the sound with its provided audio curve for a frame or two before changing to the curve that the script is supposed to apply.\n\nI also notice that, at times, audio sources with this script on it sometimes disable if you're too far away from it despite being within the radius for it.\n\nMy world experiences this issue very often as I have VRC Spatial Audio Source scripts on every audio source in it. https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_991916a7-6c03-422f-9fe5-cd74f7d796b8",
